00:55:05,383 --> 00:55:08,117
它没那么疯狂，没那么昂贵，
也没那么吓人，
It's less daft, less expensive,
less terrifying,

1082
00:55:08,150 --> 00:55:10,517
而且性能更容易让人驾驭，
and the performance is more accessible

1083
00:55:10,617 --> 00:55:14,150
因为在绝大多数时候，
它都好开得多。
because it's more controllable
for more of the time.

1084
00:55:17,083 --> 00:55:18,617
这么跟你们打个比方吧。
Let me put it this way.

1085
00:55:18,617 --> 00:55:21,183
这是一台纯种超跑。
This is a supercar.

1086
00:55:21,217 --> 00:55:23,683
一碗鲜虾牛油果水芹沙拉，
A bowl of prawns and avocado and cress,

1087
00:55:23,717 --> 00:55:27,217
鲜美可口，
但吃起来有点费劲。
delicious and tasty,
but a bit hard to handle.

1088
00:55:27,250 --> 00:55:28,850
而梅赛德斯做的事情呢，
Now, what Mercedes have done

1089
00:55:28,883 --> 00:55:31,883
就是把这套超跑的顶级食材，
is taken those same supercar ingredients

1090
00:55:31,917 --> 00:55:35,417
原封不动地夹进了两片面包当中。
but wrapped them up in two pieces of bread.

1091
00:55:36,617 --> 00:55:37,883
懂我意思了吧？
See what I mean?

1092
00:55:41,050 --> 00:55:45,050
本质上说，这就是个
鲜虾牛油果三明治。
In essence then, this is a prawn
and avocado sandwich.

1093
00:55:45,075 --> 00:55:46,975
♪ Starsailor - Four to the Floor ♪
♪ Starsailor - Four to the Floor ♪

1094
00:55:46,983 --> 00:55:51,483
有着超跑的强悍底子，
却又具备超市快餐般的便利。
Supercar innards with
supermarket convenience.

1095
00:55:51,517 --> 00:55:53,750
简直绝了，所以它比SL55
It's brilliant and I'm not at all surprised

1096
00:55:53,783 --> 00:55:57,417
贵出整整三倍，我一点也不意外。
it costs three times more than an SL55.

1097
00:55:57,450 --> 00:56:03,650
真正让我吃惊的是，它竟然只要
当年那台迈凯伦F1一半的价格。
What does surprise me is that it only costs
half as much as the old F1 did.

1098
00:56:07,683 --> 00:56:09,350
怎么了？
- 你在这儿啊。
What?
- You're here.

1099
00:56:09,383 --> 00:56:11,317
对，我在这儿。
- 还真是你。你叫什么来着？
Yes. I am.
- It's you. Your name is?

1100
00:56:11,350 --> 00:56:12,617
理查德·哈蒙德。
- 那这是一台……
Richard Hammond.
- And this is a...

1101
00:56:12,617 --> 00:56:13,850
迈凯伦SLR。
It's a McLaren SLR.

1102
00:56:13,883 --> 00:56:15,783
你在哪儿开的来着？
- 在南非。
And you drove it in?
- In South Africa,

1103
00:56:15,817 --> 00:56:18,350
而且说实话，我现在依然觉得
它的刹车就是坨垃圾。
and I still think the brakes
are, to be honest, rubbish.

1104
00:56:18,383 --> 00:56:22,050
但眼下有个更重要的问题需要回答，
那就是这台车，
But there is a more important question
to answer, and that is how is this car,

1105
00:56:22,083 --> 00:56:26,283
带着空调、定速巡航，
甚至还是个自动挡，
with its air conditioning and it
cruise control and its automatic gear box,

1106
00:56:26,317 --> 00:56:28,017
交到斯提格手里到底能跑成什么样？
gonna fare when we give it to The Stig?

1107
00:56:28,050 --> 00:56:31,717
可不是嘛，你看看咱们这圈速榜，
Exactly, I mean, if you look
at our power lap board here,

1108
00:56:31,750 --> 00:56:34,983
排在前四、前五、前六的那些，
the four, top five, six top cars

1109
00:56:35,017 --> 00:56:39,617
全都是中置后驱、专门造出来的
尖嘴扁头纯种超跑。
are all mid-engine, kind of purpose-built
snouty supercars.

1110
00:56:39,617 --> 00:56:42,450
可这家伙后备箱巨大，
而且正如你所说，还是个自动挡。
This has got a big boot
and, as you say, an automatic.

1111
00:56:42,483 --> 00:56:44,617
那它究竟能表现如何？
So, how is it gonna get on?

1112
00:56:44,617 --> 00:56:46,283
克拉克森：他冲出去了！
CLARKSON: Away he goes.

1113
00:56:46,317 --> 00:56:50,517
起步干脆利落，抓地力十足，
几乎没有任何打滑折腾。
Not much fuss there, lots of traction,
almost no drama at all.

1114
00:56:50,617 --> 00:56:52,083
♪ Whitesnake - Is This Love? ♪
♪ Whitesnake - Is This Love? ♪

1115
00:56:53,917 --> 00:56:57,517
没错，本周的深情摇滚金曲，
来自白蛇乐队！得劲。
Yes, it's this week's power ballad,
from Whitesnake! Nice.

1116
00:56:58,750 --> 00:57:00,717
进入一号弯，
And here we go into the first corner,

1117
00:57:00,750 --> 00:57:02,450
斯提格让车身保持着完美的平衡，
Stig keeping it perfectly balanced,

1118
00:57:02,483 --> 00:57:05,783
死死压在极限边缘，直奔芝加哥弯。
right on the edge there, down to Chicago.

1119
00:57:05,817 --> 00:57:07,617
进弯极快，重踩刹车，
Coming in very fast, hard on the brakes,

1120
00:57:07,650 --> 00:57:11,183
狠狠制动，一把切入，走线贴得极紧。
very hard, turning in, keeping it
really tight to the line.

1121
00:57:11,217 --> 00:57:13,517
这走线简直无可挑剔。
That is pretty much perfect.

1122
00:57:14,483 --> 00:57:16,483
好，现在进锤头弯了。
Right, Hammerhead now.

1123
00:57:16,517 --> 00:57:19,450
来了。哟……
Here we are. Ooh...

1124
00:57:19,483 --> 00:57:21,083
前置引擎的车一般都会推头。
A front-engine car will understeer.

1125
00:57:21,117 --> 00:57:23,917
完全没有，一点推头的迹象都没有。听听这声浪！
No, not a hint of it. And listen to that!

1126
00:57:23,950 --> 00:57:26,017
出弯的时候
还带了一点转向过度。
And a bit of oversteer there
on the way out.

1127
00:57:26,050 --> 00:57:27,450
太美妙了！
Glorious!

1128
00:57:27,475 --> 00:57:29,825
♪ 这难道就是……我心中的爱恋？ ♪
♪ Is this love, that I'm feeling? ♪

1129
00:57:29,850 --> 00:57:32,183
快到高速穿行弯了，
马力这么暴躁的车，
We're coming to the Follow-Through,
very powerful car,

1130
00:57:32,217 --> 00:57:33,917
他肯定得收点油吧。
surely he's going to lift.

1131
00:57:33,950 --> 00:57:36,017
他会松油门吗？
Is he gonna lift?

1132
00:57:36,050 --> 00:57:39,150
空气减速板立起来了！
他居然真刹车了，
可见他刚才冲得有多快！
Threw his air brakes up.
He's actually braking,
that's how fast he's going!

1133
00:57:39,183 --> 00:57:41,650
过那儿还踩刹车，我记得还是头一遭。
但这会拖慢圈速吗？
I think that's a first through there.
But will it hurt the time?

1134
00:57:41,683 --> 00:57:43,817
马上见分晓。
还剩最后两个弯。
That's what we're gonna know.
Two bends to go.

1135
00:57:43,850 --> 00:57:45,017
这姿态太顺滑了。
That is very smooth.

1136
00:57:45,050 --> 00:57:46,583
脏活累活全让这台车给包了。
The car's doing the hard work.

1137
00:57:46,617 --> 00:57:49,250
最后一个弯。
斯提格还在那儿小秀了一把骚操作。
Last corner. A little bit
of showboating there, Stig.

1138
00:57:49,283 --> 00:57:50,517
冲线！
And across the line!

1139
00:57:50,550 --> 00:57:52,617
来，看看他要挑战的这帮对手。
Now, these are the times he's got to beat.

1140
00:57:52,650 --> 00:57:54,883
兰博基尼是1分23秒7，
1:23.7 for the Lambo,

1141
00:57:54,917 --> 00:57:56,450
Zonda是1分23秒8，
1:23.8 for the Zonda,

1142
00:57:56,483 --> 00:57:58,517
科尼赛克是1分23秒9。
1:23.9 for the Koenigsegg.

1143
00:57:58,550 --> 00:58:00,950
另外还得赢过GT3，
而GT3……
And it's got to beat
the GT3 as well, which...

1144
00:58:01,983 --> 00:58:03,350
赢了，真的赢了。
Yes, it has.

1145
00:58:04,250 --> 00:58:05,483
它绝对赢了！
It will beat that!

1146
00:58:05,517 --> 00:58:06,550
[观众笑声]
[AUDIENCE LAUGHING]

1147
00:58:06,583 --> 00:58:08,350
实际上，它彻底把它给灭了。
In fact, it HAS beaten that.

1148
00:58:08,383 --> 00:58:11,483
它的圈速是——1分……
It has done it in one minute,

1149
00:58:11,517 --> 00:58:14,517
20秒9！
20 seconds point nine.

1150
00:58:14,550 --> 00:58:16,750
它可不只是跑赢了那帮车……
[掌声]
It hasn't just beaten them...
[APPLAUSE]

1151
00:58:19,150 --> 00:58:24,017
这是我们赛道有史以来
跑出的最快单圈纪录！
That is the fastest lap ever
round our track.

1152
00:58:24,050 --> 00:58:26,350
除了911以外。我是说，这太难得了。
Apart from the 911. I mean, this is rare.

1153
00:58:26,383 --> 00:58:31,250
911 GT……显然911本来……肯定也是更快的车。
The 911 GT... clearly a 911 obviously
would... is a faster car.

1154
00:58:31,283 --> 00:58:32,983
得了吧！它……
Oh come on! It's...

1155
00:58:33,017 --> 00:58:35,250
你真觉得GT3跑得过它？
- 那车就是个笨重的大块头。
You think a GT3 would beat that?
- It's a lumbering thing.

1156
00:58:35,283 --> 00:58:36,683
可人家是纯粹为赛道而生的车！
Well, that's a focused car.

1157
00:58:36,717 --> 00:58:39,250
这车上塞了一万种你根本用不着的破烂玩意儿，它就是个敏——
This has got tonnes of stuff
on it you don't need. It's a sharp-

1158
00:58:39,783 --> 00:58:41,950
伴随着这枚重磅炸弹，
女士们先生们，
On that bombshell,
ladies and gentlemen,

1159
00:58:41,983 --> 00:58:43,550
我们不得不向各位道晚安了。
we have to bid you good night.

1160
00:58:43,583 --> 00:58:44,783
下周见！
See you next week.

1161
00:58:44,817 --> 00:58:46,250
[掌声]
[APPLAUSE]

